---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Editorial Policy | Micro Signal Cosmos"
  description="Editorial Policy for Micro Signal Cosmos. Read our research standards, sourcing protocols, editorial independence commitments, and review workflows."
  canonical="https://microsignalcosmos.com/editorial-policy/"
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="bg-[#F7F9FC] py-12 sm:py-20">
    <div class="container-main">

      <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#697586]">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#14233B]">Home</a>
          </li>
          <li aria-hidden="true" class="text-slate-300">/</li>
          <li aria-current="page" class="font-medium text-[#14233B]">Editorial Policy</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <!-- Header Section -->
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#3478F6]"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#14233B] uppercase">
            Standards & Governance
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#14233B] sm:text-5xl">
          Editorial <span class="text-[#3478F6]">Policy</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[#697586]">
          Effective Date: November 2026 &bull; Micro Signal Cosmos Editorial Desk
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#4B5565] sm:text-lg">
          Our commitment to intellectual rigor, primary source verification, editorial independence, and accessible scientific clarity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Policy Document -->
      <article class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#4B5565] space-y-10">

        <!-- 1. Editorial Mission & Scope -->
        <section aria-labelledby="mission-scope">
          <h2 id="mission-scope" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#14233B]">
            1. Editorial Mission & Scope
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            <strong class="font-semibold text-[#14233B]">Micro Signal Cosmos</strong> was founded on the conviction that deep scientific and technological knowledge must be accessible, lucid, and grounded in evidence. Our coverage focuses on seven core disciplines: Artificial Intelligence, Deep Science, Technology & Computing, Space & Cosmos, Innovation, Future Systems, and Digital Guides.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Every article we produce is designed to cut through hype cycles, sensationalized announcements, and commercial exaggerations to provide readers with enduring conceptual insight and verifiable technical reality.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. Research & Primary Sourcing -->
        <section aria-labelledby="primary-sourcing" class="border-t border-[#E3E8EF] pt-8">
          <h2 id="primary-sourcing" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#14233B]">
            2. Research Standards & Primary Sourcing
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Our editorial desk prioritizes primary documentation above secondary synthesis. When reporting on technical architectures, algorithms, or natural discoveries, our researchers consult:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li><strong class="font-semibold text-[#14233B]">Peer-Reviewed Journals:</strong> Publications in established scientific repositories, including IEEE, ACM, Nature, Science, and arXiv preprints.</li>
            <li><strong class="font-semibold text-[#14233B]">Official Technical Documentation:</strong> Direct engineering specifications from project maintainers, standards bodies (W3C, IETF, ISO), and reputable research laboratories.</li>
            <li><strong class="font-semibold text-[#14233B]">Reproducible Codebases:</strong> Open-source repositories, benchmarks, and mathematical models that can be independently inspected and tested.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We avoid relying on anonymous commentary, unsourced social media rumors, or promotional corporate press releases without independent corroboration.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Editorial Independence -->
        <section aria-labelledby="editorial-independence" class="border-t border-[#E3E8EF] pt-8">
          <h2 id="editorial-independence" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#14233B]">
            3. Editorial Independence & Commercial Separation
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Micro Signal Cosmos maintains a strict separation between editorial content and any advertising or monetization relationships:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li><strong class="font-semibold text-[#14233B]">Zero Paid Editorial Placement:</strong> We do not accept payment, gifts, or incentives in exchange for favorable reviews, coverage inclusion, or promotional articles.</li>
            <li><strong class="font-semibold text-[#14233B]">Advertiser Isolation:</strong> Commercial advertisers have no advance review privileges, veto power, or influence over our editorial reporting.</li>
            <li><strong class="font-semibold text-[#14233B]">Transparent Labeling:</strong> Any sponsored or affiliate material will always be prominently and unambiguously labeled in full compliance with international advertising standards.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. Original Analysis & Attribution -->
        <section aria-labelledby="original-analysis" class="border-t border-[#E3E8EF] pt-8">
          <h2 id="original-analysis" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#14233B]">
            4. Originality, Fair Use & Attribution
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Plagiarism in any form is unacceptable. All published articles are original works authored by our editorial staff or invited domain contributors. When referencing external theories, figures, or discoveries:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li>Direct quotations are placed in quotation marks or formatted blockquotes with explicit author attribution.</li>
            <li>Direct outbound hyperlinks are provided to enable readers to inspect the original context.</li>
            <li>All technical diagrams, data visualizations, and editorial illustrations are produced in-house or licensed with clear provenance.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. Technology & Generative Tool Usage -->
        <section aria-labelledby="ai-assistance" class="border-t border-[#E3E8EF] pt-8">
          <h2 id="ai-assistance" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#14233B]">
            5. Transparency on Modern Tools & AI Systems
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            As a technology publication, we utilize advanced computing tools for research aggregation, code linting, grammar verification, and literature screening. However:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li>Every sentence, headline, formula, and reference published on Micro Signal Cosmos is evaluated, edited, and approved by human editors.</li>
            <li>We prohibit automated mass-generation of articles without comprehensive human verification.</li>
            <li>Our staff is held accountable for the veracity, ethical soundness, and contextual precision of all published material.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- 6. Conflicts of Interest -->
        <section aria-labelledby="conflicts" class="border-t border-[#E3E8EF] pt-8">
          <h2 id="conflicts" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#14233B]">
            6. Conflicts of Interest & Disclosures
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Editorial contributors must disclose any personal, professional, or financial investments in technologies, companies, or institutions that form the subject of their reporting. If a relevant connection exists, a transparent disclosure notice is placed at the head of the article.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Related Standards Navigation -->
        <section class="border-t border-[#E3E8EF] pt-8">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#14233B]">Related Governance Standards</h3>
          <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <a href="/fact-checking-policy/" class="rounded-lg border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-[#F7F9FC] p-3 text-xs font-semibold text-[#14233B] transition-colors hover:border-[#3478F6] hover:text-[#3478F6]">
              Fact-checking Standards &rarr;
            </a>
            <a href="/corrections-policy/" class="rounded-lg border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-[#F7F9FC] p-3 text-xs font-semibold text-[#14233B] transition-colors hover:border-[#3478F6] hover:text-[#3478F6]">
              Corrections Policy &rarr;
            </a>
            <a href="/authors/" class="rounded-lg border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-[#F7F9FC] p-3 text-xs font-semibold text-[#14233B] transition-colors hover:border-[#3478F6] hover:text-[#3478F6]">
              Authors & Contributors &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

      </article>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

